{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297921","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297921","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1029792101:1":{"text":"今回は小物を多めに持ってきたんだ。どうだ、気に入ったのはあるか？","source_cn":"这次带了不少小玩意儿来，看看有没有你喜欢的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B0F7EBD5019B019","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029792102:1":{"text":"あら、これはユグドラシルの花飾りね？","source_cn":"咦，这是薄暮丛林的花饰？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x220B8E6B02C13D7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029792103:1":{"text":"可愛い！アルマスもきっと気に入るわ。","source_cn":"真可爱，奥曼斯一定会很喜欢的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C503938B75669A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029792104:1":{"text":"へへ、そいつは良かった。なら、この前言ってたことだけど――","source_cn":"嘿嘿，既然你喜欢，那前头说过的事是不是可以谈谈了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1DB9006ED78DA97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029792105:1":{"text":"島に旅行客を連れて来て、観光や探検をするって話？","source_cn":"你是说，带一些游客来岛上观光——甚至探险？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x805793C52026331B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029792106:1":{"text":"一応あんたの縄張りだし、許可を取るのは当然だろ？","source_cn":"毕竟是你的地盘嘛，你说了算。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECC5B8C60B975031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029792107:1":{"text":"あら、それなら遠慮なく、みんなにすごい夢を好きなだけ見せちゃうわよ？","source_cn":"真的吗——那我可要为所欲为地让所有人享受很了不起的美梦了哦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8793CAA472104353","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029792108:1":{"text":"え、えっと、それはちょっと……","source_cn":"咦，这、这个可——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x273AD7C3E7EF2C59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029792109:1":{"text":"うふふ、冗談よ。心が清らかな人なら、いつでも大歓迎よ。","source_cn":"呵呵呵，开玩笑的，只要是心地纯洁的人，我随时欢迎哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x051715FD3263EA46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029792110:1":{"text":"う、さすがに客の道徳心までは確認できねえからな……やっぱ、この話はなかったことにしてくれ。","source_cn":"呃……还要考察游客的道德素养吗……那感觉还是算了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62CECC320F3E0592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"シンドバッド","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔西":{"text":"タシー","source":"塔西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}